  "name": "Sikuli legacy research implementation",
  "notes": "This is the retained Sikuli X-1.0rc3 source line, explicitly marked unsupported by its maintainers. Its documented build targets include historical macOS, Linux and Windows setups; present-day build compatibility was not tested. The official documentation cites the 2009 search/automation and 2010 visual-testing papers. Follow-up SikuliX and current OculiX are distinguished from this legacy research implementation. MIT applies to project code; external libraries keep their own terms.",
